<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cricket-Rain delays third test.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Rain delays third test.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rain delayed the start of the second day in the third and final test between South Africa and India on Friday.</p>
<p>India reached 233 for three in their first innings on Thursday.</p>
</text>
